function toolHref(id){return {check:'#category/detection',reduce:'#category/reduce',aigc:'#category/aigc',reading:'#category/literature',search:'#category/literature',journal:'#tool/posting'}[id]||'#tool/'+id;}
function newTask(){modal('新建任务',`<p class="hub-intro">选择你要完成的工作，无需先创建项目。下方工具保存到当前浏览器；科研智能助手使用服务账户。</p><div class="hub-task-picker">${quickTools.map(([id,name,desc,ico,color])=>`<a href="${toolHref(id)}"><span class="hub-row-icon ${color}">${icon(ico,24)}</span><div><b>${name}</b><p>${desc}</p></div>${icon('arrow',16)}</a>`).join('')}</div><a class="home-agent-picker" href="/service.html?view=agent">科研智能助手 · 读取材料与整理研究计划 →</a><div class="hub-picker-footer"><span>需要长期整理研究内容？</span><button class="text-btn" data-new-project>创建研究项目 →</button></div>`);}
function uploadTask(){modal('上传论文后，你想做什么？',`<p class="hub-intro">先选择用途，再进入对应页面上传。文件仅在当前浏览器处理。</p><div class="hub-upload-options"><a href="#category/detection"><span class="hub-row-icon mint">${icon('search')}</span><div><b>论文查重</b><p>解析正文，与你提供的本地材料比对</p></div>${icon('arrow',16)}</a><a href="#tool/writing"><span class="hub-row-icon">${icon('file')}</span><div><b>作为写作参考材料</b><p>支持 DOCX / PDF / TXT 本地解析与核对</p></div>${icon('arrow',16)}</a></div><p class="hub-footnote">修改支持导入正文后手动编辑；格式排版可导入 DOCX 生成排版副本，最终文件请在 Word 中核对。</p>`);}
function continueResearch(){const resume=continuationAssets(assets,projects(),homeLayout(innerWidth,innerHeight).continuations),a=resume[0];if(!a)return `<section class="card hub-card hub-continue"><div class="hub-card-heading"><h2>继续研究</h2><a href="#projects">查看项目 ${icon('arrow',14)}</a></div><div class="hub-first-task">${icon('file',30)}<h3>从你的第一份研究内容开始</h3><p>创建任务后，保存的成果会出现在这里。</p><button class="btn primary" data-new-task>开始第一个任务</button></div></section>`;
const p=projectOf(a.projectId),stage=researchStage(a);return `<section class="card hub-card hub-continue"><div class="hub-card-heading"><h2>继续研究</h2><a href="#projects">查看项目 ${icon('arrow',14)}</a></div><div class="hub-resume-row"><span class="home-document-cover" aria-hidden="true">${icon(a.tool==='ppt'?'chart':a.type==='report'?'search':'file',36)}<span>PaperKnow</span></span><div class="hub-row-copy"><b>${esc(a.title)}</b><p>${esc(p?[p.degree,p.major].filter(Boolean).join(' · '):a.degree||'独立任务')} · ${esc(a.kind)} · ${formatDate(a.stamp)}</p></div>${badge(a.type==='report'?'报告已生成':a.data.stage==='draft'?'草稿已保存':'成果已保存','mint')}<a class="btn primary" href="${esc(a.url)}">${a.type==='report'?'查看报告':'继续编辑'}</a></div><div class="home-resume-next"><span>研究记录</span><b>${esc(p?.name||'独立研究任务')}</b><span>${stage?'可继续完善当前成果，或查看关联资料。':'继续编辑这份成果，或将它归入研究项目。'}</span></div>${stage?`<div class="hub-research-stages" aria-label="当前内容对应的研究阶段">${stages.map(([id,label])=>`<span class="${id===stage?'current':''}" ${id===stage?'aria-current="step"':''}><i>${id===stage?'<span></span>':''}</i>${label}</span>`).join('')}</div><p class="hub-stage-note">高亮表示当前成果类型，不代表其他阶段已完成。</p>`:''}${resume.length>1?`<div class="home-other-research"><h3>其他研究记录</h3>${resume.slice(1).map(item=>`<a href="${esc(item.url)}"><span class="hub-row-icon">${icon(item.tool==='ppt'?'chart':'folder',20)}</span><div><b>${esc(projectOf(item.projectId)?.name||item.title)}</b><p>${esc(item.kind)} · ${formatDate(item.stamp)}</p></div>${icon('arrow',16)}</a>`).join('')}</div>`:''}</section>`;}
function homeResults(){const rows=recentAssets(assets,homeAssetFilter).slice(0,homeResultLimit);return `<div class="hub-card-heading"><h2>最近成果</h2><a href="#assets">查看全部 ${icon('arrow',14)}</a></div><div class="hub-home-tabs" role="group" aria-label="最近成果分类">${[['all','全部'],['writing','写作'],['detection','检测'],['presentation','演示']].map(([id,label])=>`<button aria-pressed="${id===homeAssetFilter}" data-home-filter="${id}" class="${id===homeAssetFilter?'active':''}">${label}</button>`).join('')}</div><div id="home-result-list">${rows.map(homeAssetRow).join('')||empty('此分类暂无保存的成果。',homeAssetFilter==='detection'?'#category/detection':homeAssetFilter==='presentation'?'#tool/ppt':'#category/writing','开始任务')}</div><p class="hub-footnote" id="home-results-note">当前展示 ${rows.length} 份成果 · 所有保存记录可在“我的成果”中查看。</p>`;}
function adaptHomeLayout(){if(!$('.home-refresh'))return;const resume=$('#home-resume');if(resume)resume.innerHTML=continueResearch();const panel=$('#home-results'),listElement=$('#home-result-list');if(!panel||!listElement)return;const rows=listElement.querySelectorAll('.hub-asset-row'),rowHeight=rows[0]?.getBoundingClientRect().height||78;
homeResultLimit=fitHomeRows({width:innerWidth,height:innerHeight,listTop:listElement.getBoundingClientRect().top+window.scrollY,rowHeight,footerHeight:85});const items=recentAssets(assets,homeAssetFilter).slice(0,homeResultLimit);listElement.innerHTML=items.map(homeAssetRow).join('')||empty('此分类暂无保存的成果。',homeAssetFilter==='detection'?'#category/detection':homeAssetFilter==='presentation'?'#tool/ppt':'#category/writing','开始任务');$('#home-results-note').textContent=`当前展示 ${items.length} 份成果 · 所有保存记录可在“我的成果”中查看。`;}
let homeResizeTimer;window.addEventListener('resize',()=>{clearTimeout(homeResizeTimer);homeResizeTimer=setTimeout(()=>{requestAnimationFrame(()=>{adaptHomeLayout();adaptProjectLayout();});},120);});
function homeAssetRow(a){const color=a.type==='report'?'rose':a.tool==='ppt'?'amber':a.tool==='research'?'mint':a.revision||a.data?.revision?'violet':'blue';return assetRow(a).replace('class="hub-row-icon '+(a.type==='report'?'mint':'')+'"','class="hub-row-icon '+color+'"');}
function homeSide(){const cap=homeService?.cap,user=homeService?.user;const tasks=homeService?.jobs||[];const status={queued:'排队中',running:'处理中',completed:'已完成',failed:'失败',cancelled:'已取消',record:'操作记录'};const local=allTasks().slice(0,2);const lines=user?tasks.slice(0,3).map(t=>({title:{agent:'科研智能助手',parse:'文档解析',polish:'论文润色',review:'修改建议',compare:'材料比对'}[t.type]||'研究任务',status:t.status,createdAt:t.created_at,url:'/service.html?view=tasks'})):local;
const bytes=(homeService?.files||[]).reduce((n,f)=>n+Number(f.bytes||0),0),calls=homeService?.usage||[];const tokens=calls.filter(v=>v.input_tokens!=null&&v.output_tokens!=null).reduce((n,v)=>n+v.input_tokens+v.output_tokens,0);
return `<section class="card hub-card hub-current-task"><div class="hub-card-heading"><h2>任务动态</h2><a href="${user?'/service.html?view=tasks':'#tasks'}">查看全部 ${icon('arrow',14)}</a></div><p class="home-source">${user?'服务账户 · '+esc(user.name||user.email||user.phone||'研究者'):'当前浏览器的任务记录'}</p>${lines.length?lines.map(t=>`<a class="home-task-line" href="${esc(t.url||'#tasks')}"><span class="hub-row-icon ${t.status==='completed'?'mint':''}">${icon(t.status==='completed'?'shield':'clock',19)}</span><div><b>${esc(t.title)}</b><small>${formatDate(t.createdAt)}</small></div>${badge(status[t.status]||'操作记录',t.status==='completed'?'mint':'gray')}</a>`).join(''):`<div class="home-task-zero">${icon('clock',24)}<div><b>${homeService?.error?'服务数据暂不可用':'暂无任务记录'}</b><p>${homeService?.error?'可进入服务账户检查连接。':'从新建任务开始你的研究。'}</p></div></div><button class="btn secondary" data-new-task>创建研究任务</button>`}</section><section class="card hub-card hub-usage"><div class="hub-card-heading"><h2>用量与权益</h2>${badge(user?'服务账户':'本地体验')}</div>${user?`<div class="home-metric"><span>模型调用记录</span><b>${calls.length}${calls.length===100?' 条（最近）':' 条'}</b></div><div class="home-metric"><span>已知输入与输出 Token</span><b>${tokens.toLocaleString('zh-CN')}</b></div><div class="home-metric"><span>原件存储</span><b>${(bytes/1024/1024).toFixed(2)} MB</b></div><p class="hub-footnote">来自当前账户，最多统计最近 100 条用量记录；缺失 Token 不计入总量。</p>`:`<div class="home-metric"><span>本地研究项目</span><b>${projects().length} 个</b></div><div class="home-metric"><span>本地成果</span><b>${recentAssets(assets).length} 份</b></div><p class="hub-footnote">${homeService?.error?'服务连接暂不可用，本地编辑仍可使用。':'登录服务账户后可查看模型调用与原件存储。'}</p>`}<div class="home-model-status">${icon('grid',16)}${cap?cap.agent?'科研智能助手可用':'科研智能助手暂未开放':homeService?.error?'服务状态暂不可用':'正在读取服务状态'}<a href="/service.html?view=agent">${cap?.agent?'开始使用':'查看服务'} →</a></div><a class="btn secondary home-plan-link" href="${user?'/service.html?view=membership':'#membership/plans'}">${icon('diamond',17)}查看套餐与权益</a><p class="home-source">${cap?.payment?'':'支付尚未开放，当前不扣费。'}</p></section><section class="card hub-card hub-side-help"><div class="hub-card-heading"><h2>研究指南</h2><a href="#help">更多 ${icon('arrow',14)}</a></div><a href="#category/writing">${icon('book',20)}如何开始一篇论文？ ${icon('arrow',14)}</a><a href="#help">${icon('file',20)}如何导出 Word / PDF？ ${icon('arrow',14)}</a></section><a class="hub-data-note" href="#settings/privacy">${icon('shield',25)}<div><b>重要成果建议及时导出备份</b><p>本地成果保存在当前浏览器。</p></div>${icon('arrow',16)}</a>`;}
async function loadHomeService(){const request=++homeRequest;try{const data=await readHomeService(workspaceServiceFetch);if(request===homeRequest&&data.user?.id===workspaceSession.user?.id)homeService=data;}catch{if(request===homeRequest)homeService={error:true};}if(request===homeRequest&&$('.home-service-side'))$('.home-service-side').innerHTML=homeSide();}
function overview(){homeResultLimit=homeLayout(innerWidth,innerHeight).results;homeService=null;$('.dashboard').classList.add('home-refresh');$('.dashboard').innerHTML=`<section class="home-welcome"><div class="home-welcome-copy"><span class="home-welcome-eyebrow"><span></span> PAPERKNOW · 研究工作空间</span><h1>把想法，推进成成果。</h1><p>从一份资料、一个问题开始，连接你的每一步研究。</p><div class="home-welcome-actions"><button class="btn primary" data-new-task>${icon('plus',17)}新建研究任务</button><button class="btn secondary" data-upload-task>${icon('upload',17)}导入论文资料</button></div></div><a class="home-agent-entry" href="/service.html?view=agent"><div class="home-agent-top"><span class="home-agent-symbol">${icon('grid',23)}</span><span class="home-agent-label">科研智能助手</span>${icon('arrow',19)}</div><div class="home-agent-title">让复杂的研究<br>有一个清晰的起点</div><div class="home-agent-bottom"><span>整理材料 · 梳理研究计划</span><span class="home-agent-cta">打开助手 ${icon('arrow',14)}</span></div><span class="home-agent-orbit" aria-hidden="true"></span></a></section><div class="home-metrics"><div class="home-metric-card blue"><span class="hub-row-icon">${icon("file",21)}</span><div><small>文献总数</small><b>${assets.filter(a=>assetCategory(a)==="literature").length}</b></div></div><div class="home-metric-card mint"><span class="hub-row-icon">${icon("folder",21)}</span><div><small>进行中的项目</small><b>${projects().filter(p=>p.status!=="archived").length}</b></div></div><div class="home-metric-card violet"><span class="hub-row-icon">${icon("clock",21)}</span><div><small>待完成任务</small><b>${allTasks().filter(t=>!["completed","cancelled"].includes(t.status)).length}</b></div></div><div class="home-metric-card amber"><span class="hub-row-icon">${icon("chart",21)}</span><div><small>本月新增成果</small><b>${assets.length}</b></div></div></div><section class="home-commercial-panel" aria-label="PaperRed 高频能力"><div class="home-commercial-heading"><div><span class="capabilities-kicker">PAPERKNOW SERVICES</span><h2>论文交付常用能力</h2><p>先免费体验查重，再按需要进入降重、降 AIGC、排版和 PPT 服务。</p></div><a class="btn secondary" href="#membership/plans">查看套餐与权益 ${icon('arrow',14)}</a></div><div class="home-commercial-grid">${commercialTools.map(([id,name,desc,ico,color,action])=>`<a class="home-commercial-card ${id==='writing'?'featured':''}" href="${toolHref(id)}"><span class="home-commercial-icon ${color}">${icon(ico,23)}</span><div><div class="home-commercial-title"><h3>${name}</h3>${id==='check'?'<span class="home-commercial-badge">免费</span>':id==='aigc'?'<span class="home-commercial-badge muted">待开放</span>':''}</div><p>${desc}</p><span class="home-commercial-action">${action} ${icon('arrow',14)}</span></div></a>`).join('')}</div></section><div class="home-tools-heading"><h2>常用工具</h2><a href="#category/more">更多工具 ${icon('arrow',14)}</a></div><div class="hub-quick-grid">${quickTools.map(([id,name,desc,ico,color])=>`<a class="hub-quick" href="${toolHref(id)}"><span class="hub-row-icon ${color}">${icon(ico,24)}</span><div><h3>${name}</h3><p>${desc}</p></div></a>`).join('')}</div><div class="hub-overview-grid"><div><div id="home-resume">${continueResearch()}</div><section class="card hub-card hub-results" id="home-results">${homeResults()}</section><p class="home-source">项目与成果来自当前浏览器 · <a href="/service.html?view=results">查看服务账户成果 →</a></p></div><div class="hub-overview-side home-service-side">${homeSide()}</div></div>`;loadHomeService();requestAnimationFrame(()=>{adaptHomeLayout();if(window.scrollY<80){const tab=document.querySelector('[data-home-tab=overview]');if(tab){document.querySelectorAll('[data-home-tab]').forEach(b=>{const active=b===tab;b.classList.toggle('active',active);b.setAttribute('aria-selected',active?'true':'false');});}}});}
function projectForm(id){const p=projectOf(id),pref=preferences();modal(p?'编辑项目':'新建研究项目',`<form id="project-form" class="hub-form"><label for="project-name">项目名称</label><input id="project-name" required minlength="2" maxlength="120" value="${esc(p?.name||'')}" placeholder="例如：人工智能辅助课堂学习反馈研究"><div class="hub-form-row"><div><label for="project-degree">学段 / 身份</label><select id="project-degree">${['专科','本科','硕士','博士','科研人员'].map(d=>`<option ${d===(p?.degree||pref.degree)?'selected':''}>${d}</option>`).join('')}</select></div><div><label for="project-major">学科专业</label><input id="project-major" maxlength="100" value="${esc(p?.major||pref.major)}" placeholder="例如：教育学"></div></div><div class="hub-form-row"><div><label for="project-type">项目类型</label><select id="project-type"><option value="">未分类研究</option>${projectTypes.map(t=>`<option ${p?.type===t?'selected':''}>${t}</option>`).join('')}</select></div><div><label for="project-stage">当前阶段</label><select id="project-stage"><option value="">尚未设置</option>${projectStages.map(([key,label])=>`<option value="${key}" ${p?.stage===key?'selected':''}>${label}</option>`).join('')}</select></div></div><label for="project-description">研究说明（可选）</label><textarea id="project-description" rows="4" maxlength="2000" placeholder="记录研究目标与当前阶段…">${esc(p?.description||'')}</textarea><p class="hub-intro">项目和关联关系只保存在当前浏览器，不会自动上传。</p><p id="project-error" role="alert"></p><button class="btn primary" type="submit">${p?'保存项目':'创建项目'}</button></form>`);$('#project-form').addEventListener('submit',e=>{e.preventDefault();const name=$('#project-name').value.trim();if(name.length<2){$('#project-error').textContent='项目名称至少填写 2 个字。';return;}try{const item=saveProject({name,type:$('#project-type').value,stage:$('#project-stage').value,degree:$('#project-degree').value,major:$('#project-major').value.trim(),description:$('#project-description').value.trim()},id);$('#'+dialogId).close();location.hash='project/'+item.id;if(id)render();}catch{$('#project-error').textContent='无法保存，请检查浏览器存储空间。';}});}
function projectStageMarkup(p){return `<div class="project-stage-heading"><b>当前阶段</b><button class="text-btn" data-stage-project="${esc(p.id)}">手动设置 ${icon('pen',14)}</button></div><div class="hub-research-stages project-stages" aria-label="手动设置的研究阶段">${projectStages.map(([id,label])=>`<span class="${p.stage===id?'current':''}" ${p.stage===id?'aria-current="step"':''}><i>${p.stage===id?'<span></span>':''}</i>${label}</span>`).join('')}</div>${!p.stage?'<p class="hub-stage-note">尚未设置阶段，请根据实际研究进展选择。</p>':''}`;}
function projectMenu(p){return `<details class="project-menu"><summary aria-label="${esc(p.name)}的更多操作">···</summary><div><button data-edit-project="${esc(p.id)}">编辑项目</button><button data-stage-project="${esc(p.id)}">设置阶段</button><button data-link-project="${esc(p.id)}">关联已有成果</button><button data-archive-project="${esc(p.id)}">${p.status==='archived'?'恢复项目':'归档项目'}</button></div></details>`;}
function projectAssetIcon(a,size=22){const category=assetCategory(a),color=category==='research'?'teal':category==='presentation'?'orange':category==='detection'?'violet':'blue',shape=category==='research'||category==='presentation'?'chart':category==='detection'?'shield':'file';return `<span class="hub-row-icon project-file-icon ${color}">${icon(shape,size)}</span>`;}
function projectAssetRow(a){return assetRow(a).replace(/<span class="hub-row-icon[^"]*">.*?<\/span>/,projectAssetIcon(a));}
function projectWelcome(ps){
 const active=ps.filter(p=>p.status!=='archived'),latest=selectProjects(active,assets)[0],ids=new Set(ps.map(p=>p.id)),count=assets.filter(a=>ids.has(a.projectId)).length;
 return `<section class="project-welcome"><div class="project-welcome-copy"><span class="project-eyebrow">PAPERKNOW · 我的项目</span><h1>让每一项研究，都有清晰的进展。</h1><p>整理论文、连接材料，继续你的研究。PaperKnow 与你一起，把思路变成成果。</p><div class="project-welcome-bottom"><div class="project-welcome-actions"><button class="btn primary" data-new-project>${icon('plus',18)}新建项目</button><button class="btn secondary" data-upload-task>${icon('upload',17)}导入论文</button></div><div class="project-welcome-counts"><span><b>${ps.length}</b> 个项目</span><span><b>${active.length}</b> 个进行中</span><span><b>${count}</b> 份成果</span></div></div></div><a class="project-welcome-next project-assistant-card" href="${latest?'#project/'+esc(latest.id):'#category/writing'}"><span class="project-next-orbits" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="project-assistant-heading">${icon('grid',22)}<span>PaperKnow 助手</span>${icon('arrow',17)}</div><strong>你的 AI 研究伙伴</strong><p>从文献阅读到论文写作，<br>让研究更高效、更专注。</p><b>${latest?'打开项目':'打开助手'} ${icon('arrow',18)}</b></a></section>`;
}
let projectResultFilter='all',projectResultLimit=5;
function projectCard(p,featured=false){
 const info=projectSummary(p,assets),archived=p.status==='archived',stage=projectStages.find(([id])=>id===p.stage)?.[1]||'尚未设置';
 return `<article class="project-card project-summary-card ${featured?'project-featured':''}"><div class="project-card-header"><span class="hub-row-icon">${icon('folder',28)}</span><div class="hub-row-copy"><div class="project-tags">${badge(esc(p.type||'未分类研究'))}${badge(archived?'已归档':'进行中',archived?'gray':'mint')}</div><h2><a href="#project/${esc(p.id)}">${esc(p.name)}</a></h2><p>${esc(p.degree||'学段待填写')} · ${esc(p.major||'学科待填写')}</p></div>${projectMenu(p)}</div><p class="project-description">${esc(p.description||'记录研究目标，让下一步更清晰。')}</p><div class="project-summary-metrics"><div><span>当前阶段 · 手动设置</span><button class="text-btn" data-stage-project="${esc(p.id)}">${esc(stage)} ${icon('pen',13)}</button></div><div><span>已关联成果</span><b>${info.related.length} 份</b></div><div><span>最近更新</span><b>${formatDate(info.activity)}</b></div></div><div class="project-stage-timeline" aria-label="研究进度">${projectStages.map(([id,label],index)=>`<span class="${p.stage===id?'current':''} ${p.stage&&projectStages.findIndex(([key])=>key===p.stage)>index?'done':''}"><i>${p.stage&&projectStages.findIndex(([key])=>key===p.stage)>index?'✓':index+1}</i><b>${label}</b><small>${p.stage===id?'进行中':p.stage&&projectStages.findIndex(([key])=>key===p.stage)>index?'已完成':'待开始'}</small></span>`).join('')}</div>${!archived?`<div class="project-resume">${info.latest?projectAssetIcon(info.latest,24):'<span class="hub-row-icon project-file-icon blue">'+icon('file',24)+'</span>'}<div class="project-resume-copy"><span>${info.latest?'继续上次研究':'开始项目研究'}</span><b>${esc(info.latest?.title||'从一份论文大纲开始')}</b><small>${esc(info.latest?.kind||'整理研究方向与论文框架')}</small></div><a class="btn primary" href="${esc(info.latest?.url||'#tool/writing?project='+p.id)}">${info.latest?.type==='report'?'查看报告':info.latest?'继续编辑':'创建大纲'}</a></div>`:''}<div class="project-card-actions"><a class="project-enter" href="#project/${esc(p.id)}">查看项目详情 ${icon('arrow',15)}</a><button class="btn secondary" data-edit-project="${esc(p.id)}">${icon('pen',15)}编辑项目</button></div></article>`;
}
function projectActivity(ps){
 const ids=new Set(ps.map(p=>p.id)),recent=assets.filter(a=>ids.has(a.projectId)).slice(0,3);
 return `<aside class="project-activity-panel"><div class="project-panel-heading"><h2>最近活动</h2><span>最近保存记录</span></div>${recent.length?`<div class="project-activity-list">${recent.map(a=>`<a href="${esc(a.url)}">${projectAssetIcon(a,21)}<div><b>${esc(a.kind)}${a.type==='report'?'已生成':'已保存'}</b><p>${esc(a.title)}</p><small>${formatDate(a.stamp)}</small></div>${icon('arrow',14)}</a>`).join('')}</div>`:'<div class="project-panel-empty">保存第一份成果后，可在这里继续查看。</div>'}<p class="project-panel-note">展示成果的最近保存时间。</p></aside>`;
}
function projectResults(ps){
 const ids=new Set(ps.map(p=>p.id)),related=assets.filter(a=>ids.has(a.projectId));if(projectResultFilter!=='all'&&!related.some(a=>assetCategory(a)===projectResultFilter))projectResultFilter='all';const visible=related.filter(a=>projectResultFilter==='all'||assetCategory(a)===projectResultFilter),tabs=assetCategories.filter(([id])=>id==='all'||related.some(a=>assetCategory(a)===id));
 return `<section class="project-results-panel"><div class="project-panel-heading"><h2>项目成果</h2><button class="text-btn" data-project-all-assets="${ps.length===1?esc(ps[0].id):'all'}">${ps.length===1?'查看全部':'管理成果'} ${icon('arrow',14)}</button></div><div class="hub-tabs project-result-tabs">${tabs.map(([id,label])=>`<button data-project-result-filter="${id}" class="${projectResultFilter===id?'active':''}" aria-pressed="${projectResultFilter===id}">${label}${id==='all'?` ${related.length}`:''}</button>`).join('')}</div><div class="project-result-rows">${visible.slice(0,projectResultLimit).map(projectAssetRow).join('')||`<div class="project-panel-empty">${related.length?'此分类暂无成果。':'暂无关联成果。可在项目详情中创建内容或关联已有成果。'}</div>`}</div>${visible.length?`<p class="project-panel-note">已展示最近 ${Math.min(visible.length,projectResultLimit)} 份成果，共 ${visible.length} 份。</p>`:''}</section>`;
}
function projectRows(){
 const ps=selectProjects(projects(),assets,{status:activeProjectFilter,query:projectQuery,sort:projectSort}),node=$('#project-rows');node.className='project-overview';
 node.innerHTML=ps.length?`<div class="project-overview-top ${ps.length===1&&projectView==='cards'?'single-project':''}"><div class="project-grid ${projectView==='list'?'project-list':''}">${ps.map(p=>projectCard(p,ps.length===1)).join('')}</div>${projectActivity(ps)}</div><div class="project-bottom-grid">${projectResults(ps)}<aside class="project-quick-panel"><div class="project-panel-heading"><h2>快速操作</h2></div><button class="project-quick-action" data-workspace-backup>${icon('upload',20)}<span><b>导出备份</b><small>导出本项目的全部成果</small></span>${icon('arrow',15)}</button><a class="project-quick-action" href="#settings">${icon('settings',20)}<span><b>项目设置</b><small>管理项目成员与信息</small></span>${icon('arrow',15)}</a><div class="project-tip">${icon('bulb',20)}<span><b>小提示</b><small>定期导出备份，<br>安全保存你的研究成果。</small></span></div></aside></div>`:`<div class="project-empty">${icon('folder',38)}<h2>${projects().length?'没有匹配的项目':'创建你的第一个研究项目'}</h2><p>${projects().length?'试试其他关键词，或重置筛选。':'将研究说明、写作成果和检测报告整理在一起。'}</p><button class="btn primary" ${projects().length?'data-reset-projects':'data-new-project'}>${projects().length?'重置筛选':'新建项目'}</button></div>`;requestAnimationFrame(adaptProjectLayout);
}
function adaptProjectLayout(){
 const listElement=$('.project-result-rows'),footer=$('.project-purpose');if(!listElement||!footer)return;
 const rows=[...listElement.querySelectorAll('.hub-asset-row')];if(!rows.length)return;
 const box=listElement.getBoundingClientRect(),rowHeight=rows.reduce((sum,row)=>sum+row.getBoundingClientRect().height,0)/rows.length;
 const next=fitProjectRows({width:innerWidth,height:innerHeight,listTop:box.top+scrollY,rowHeight,footerHeight:footer.getBoundingClientRect().bottom-box.bottom+32});
 if(next!==projectResultLimit){projectResultLimit=next;const ps=selectProjects(projects(),assets,{status:activeProjectFilter,query:projectQuery,sort:projectSort});const panel=$('.project-results-panel'),focus=document.activeElement?.dataset.projectResultFilter;panel.outerHTML=projectResults(ps);if(focus)document.querySelector(`[data-project-result-filter="${focus}"]`)?.focus({preventScroll:true});}
}
function renderProjects(){const ps=projects(),archived=ps.filter(p=>p.status==='archived').length,active=ps.filter(p=>p.status!=='archived'),linked=assets.filter(a=>ps.some(p=>p.id===a.projectId)).length,pending=allTasks().filter(t=>!['completed','cancelled'].includes(t.status)).length;$('.dashboard').innerHTML=`${projectWelcome(ps)}<div class="project-metrics-strip"><div><span class="hub-row-icon blue">${icon('folder',20)}</span><b>${ps.length}</b><small>项目总数</small></div><div><span class="hub-row-icon mint">${icon('file',20)}</span><b>${linked}</b><small>累计成果</small></div><div><span class="hub-row-icon amber">${icon('clock',20)}</span><b>${active.length}</b><small>进行中</small></div><div><span class="hub-row-icon violet">${icon('shield',20)}</span><b>${pending}</b><small>待处理任务</small></div></div><section class="project-toolbar"><div class="hub-tabs">${[['all','全部',ps.length],['active','进行中',ps.length-archived],['archived','已归档',archived]].map(([id,name,count])=>`<button data-project-filter="${id}" class="${id===activeProjectFilter?'active':''}" aria-pressed="${id===activeProjectFilter}">${name} <span>${count}</span></button>`).join('')}</div><div class="project-toolbar-right"><label class="project-search">${icon('search',16)}<input id="project-query" aria-label="搜索项目名称或研究方向" placeholder="搜索项目名称或研究方向" value="${esc(projectQuery)}"></label><select id="project-sort" aria-label="项目排序">${[['activity','最近活动'],['created','创建时间'],['name','项目名称']].map(([id,label])=>`<option value="${id}" ${projectSort===id?'selected':''}>${label}</option>`).join('')}</select><div class="project-view-toggle" aria-label="项目视图"><button data-project-view="cards" aria-label="卡片视图" aria-pressed="${projectView==='cards'}" class="${projectView==='cards'?'active':''}">${icon('grid',18)}</button><button data-project-view="list" aria-label="列表视图" aria-pressed="${projectView==='list'}" class="${projectView==='list'?'active':''}">${icon('menu',18)}</button></div></div></section><div id="project-rows"></div><div class="project-backup"><span class="hub-row-icon">${icon('shield',28)}</span><div><b>本地保存 · 建议定期备份</b><p>当前项目与成果保存在此浏览器，更换设备不会自动同步。</p></div><button class="btn secondary" data-workspace-backup>导出备份</button></div><p class="project-purpose">${icon('book',19)}项目用于长期组织研究；单次写作或查重，可直接在工作台新建任务。<a href="#home">工作台 ${icon('arrow',14)}</a></p>`;projectRows();$('#project-query').addEventListener('input',e=>{projectQuery=e.target.value;projectRows();});$('#project-sort').addEventListener('change',e=>{projectSort=e.target.value;guard(()=>write(keys.preferences,{...preferences(),projectSort}));projectRows();});}
function stageForm(id){const p=projectOf(id);if(!p)return;modal('设置研究阶段',`<form class="hub-form" id="project-stage-form"><p class="hub-intro">${esc(p.name)}：根据实际研究进展选择，不会自动标记其他阶段完成。</p><label for="project-stage-select">当前阶段</label><select id="project-stage-select"><option value="">尚未设置</option>${projectStages.map(([key,label])=>`<option value="${key}" ${key===p.stage?'selected':''}>${label}</option>`).join('')}</select><button class="btn primary" type="submit">保存阶段</button></form>`);$('#project-stage-form').addEventListener('submit',e=>{e.preventDefault();guard(()=>{saveProject({stage:$('#project-stage-select').value},id);$('#'+dialogId).close();render();notify('研究阶段已保存。');});});}
async function exportWorkspace(){try{const backup={format:'paperknow-workspace-backup',version:1,exportedAt:new Date().toISOString(),...await currentBackup()};download('PaperKnow-工作空间备份.json',JSON.stringify(backup,null,2),'application/json');notify('已发起备份下载，请确认浏览器已保存文件。');}catch(error){notify('备份导出失败：'+error.message);}}
function projectDetail(id){const p=projectOf(id);if(!p){$('.dashboard').innerHTML=heading('项目不存在','可能在其他浏览器中创建，或当前存储中没有此项目。')+empty('返回项目列表查看。','#projects');return;}const related=assets.filter(a=>a.projectId===id);$('.dashboard').innerHTML=`${heading(esc(p.name),`${esc(p.degree)} · ${esc(p.major||'学科待填写')} · ${p.status==='archived'?'已归档':'进行中'}`,`<button class="btn secondary" data-edit-project="${esc(id)}">编辑项目</button><button class="btn secondary" data-archive-project="${esc(id)}">${p.status==='archived'?'恢复项目':'归档项目'}</button>`)}<div class="hub-project-actions"><a class="btn primary" href="#tool/writing?project=${encodeURIComponent(id)}">创建论文大纲</a><a class="btn secondary" href="#category/detection?project=${encodeURIComponent(id)}">上传论文查重</a><button class="btn secondary" data-link-project="${esc(id)}">关联已有成果</button></div><section class="card hub-card">${projectStageMarkup(p)}<h2 style="margin-top:24px">研究说明</h2><p class="hub-description">${esc(p.description||'还没有研究说明，点击编辑项目补充。')}</p><p class="hub-footnote">项目创建于 ${formatDate(p.createdAt)} · 归档只改变项目状态，不删除关联成果。</p></section><section class="card hub-card"><div class="hub-card-heading"><h2>项目成果</h2>${badge(related.length+' 份')}</div>${related.map(assetRow).join('')||empty('暂未关联成果，可创建大纲或关联已有记录。')}</section>`;}
function linkProject(id){modal('关联已有成果',`<p class="hub-intro">将当前浏览器中的成果归入此项目，不会改变正文或报告内容。</p><div class="hub-link-list">${assets.map(a=>`<div><span><b>${esc(a.title)}</b><small>${esc(a.kind)} · ${esc(projectOf(a.projectId)?.name||'未归入项目')}</small></span><button class="btn secondary" data-bind-asset="${esc(a.type+':'+a.id)}" data-target-project="${esc(id)}" ${a.projectId===id?'disabled':''}>${a.projectId===id?'已关联':'关联'}</button></div>`).join('')||empty('还没有成果。','#category/writing')}</div>`);}
async function bindAsset(type,id,projectId){try{if(type==='draft'){const rows=list(keys.drafts);write(keys.drafts,rows.map(d=>String(d.id)===id?{...d,projectId}:d));}else{const r=reports.find(r=>r.id===id);if(!r)throw Error();const updated={...r,projectId};await repository.save('reports',updated);reports=reports.map(r=>r.id===id?updated:r);}refreshAssets();notify(projectId?'成果已关联项目。':'已解除项目关联。');render();if($('#'+dialogId).open)linkProject(projectId);}catch{notify('关联失败，原成果仍保留。');}}
function assetToken(a){return a.type+':'+a.id;}
function assetByToken(token){return assets.find(a=>assetToken(a)===token);}
function assetDate(a){return a.stamp?new Date(a.stamp).toLocaleString('zh-CN',{month:'2-digit',day:'2-digit',hour:'2-digit',minute:'2-digit',hour12:false}):'时间未记录';}
function assetDescription(a){if(['posting','resume'].includes(a.tool))return a.kind+' · 本地整理 · 可编辑及导出 TXT';if(a.type==='report')return a.data.sources?.some(s=>s.kind==='demo')?'含演示材料 · 本地比对报告':'本地材料比对 · 可核对来源';if(a.tool==='format')return '排版文档 · 原件保留 · 可导出 DOCX';if(a.tool==='research')return a.data.chart?'科研图表 · 可编辑数据及导出 SVG / PNG':'旧版绘图记录';if(a.tool==='ppt')return a.data.presentation?.slides?.length?'演示文稿 · 可编辑及导出 PPTX':'演示草稿 · 待完善大纲';return a.kind+' · '+(['draft','body'].includes(a.data.stage)?'可继续编辑':'结构模板');}
function assetStatus(a){return a.type==='report'?['已完成','mint']:a.data?.stage==='draft'?['草稿','amber']:['可编辑','blue'];}
function assetTableRow(a){const token=esc(assetToken(a)),p=projectOf(a.projectId),[status,statusTone]=assetStatus(a);return `<tr><td class="asset-check-cell"><input type="checkbox" aria-label="选择${esc(a.title)}" data-asset-select="${token}"></td><td><div class="asset-name"><span class="hub-row-icon ${a.type==='report'?'teal':''}">${icon(a.type==='report'?'search':a.tool==='ppt'?'chart':assetCategory(a)==='literature'?'book':'file',20)}</span><div><a class="asset-title" href="${esc(a.url)}">${esc(a.title)}</a><small>${esc(assetDescription(a))}</small></div></div></td><td><span class="asset-type ${a.type==='report'?'report':''}">${esc(a.kind)}</span></td><td>${p?`<a class="asset-project" href="#project/${encodeURIComponent(p.id)}">${esc(p.name)}</a>`:'<span class="asset-muted">未归入项目</span>'}</td><td><time class="asset-time">${esc(assetDate(a))}</time></td><td>${badge(status,statusTone)}</td><td><div class="asset-actions"><a href="${esc(a.url)}">${a.type==='report'?'查看报告':'继续编辑'}</a><button data-asset-export="${token}">导出</button><details class="asset-menu"><summary aria-label="更多操作：${esc(a.title)}">⋯</summary><div><button data-asset-project="${token}">移动到项目</button><button data-asset-info="${token}">查看成果信息</button></div></details></div></td></tr>`;}
function updateAssetTable(){let selected=selectAssets(assets,{category:'all',project:assetProject,query:assetQuery,sort:assetSort},projects());if(['draft','done','pending','archived'].includes(assetFilter))selected=selected.filter(a=>assetFilter==='draft'?a.type!=='report'&&a.data?.stage==='draft':assetFilter==='done'?a.type==='report':assetFilter==='pending'?a.type!=='report'&&a.data?.stage!=='draft':false);else if(assetFilter!=='all')selected=selected.filter(a=>assetCategory(a)===assetFilter);$('#asset-count').textContent=`共 ${selected.length} 份成果`;$('[data-asset-select-all]')?.setAttribute('aria-label',`全选 ${selected.length} 份成果`);$('#asset-table-body').innerHTML=selected.map(assetTableRow).join('')||`<tr><td colspan="7"><div class="asset-empty">${icon('file',32)}<h3>${assets.length?'没有匹配的成果':'开始积累你的研究成果'}</h3><p>${assets.length?'尝试调整分类、项目或关键词。':'保存大纲、创作模板或比对报告后，会显示在这里。'}</p>${assets.length?'<button class="btn secondary" data-reset-assets>清除筛选</button>':'<button class="btn primary" data-new-task>新建任务</button>'}</div></td></tr>`;}
function renderAssets(){const draftCount=assets.filter(a=>a.type!=='report'&&a.data?.stage==='draft').length,doneCount=assets.filter(a=>a.type==='report').length,pendingCount=assets.filter(a=>a.type!=='report'&&a.data?.stage!=='draft').length,weekCount=assets.filter(a=>Date.now()-(a.stamp||0)<7*86400000).length,recent=assets.slice(0,2);$('.dashboard').innerHTML=`${heading('我的成果','集中管理写作、检测和演示成果。','<button class="btn primary" data-new-task>'+icon('plus',16)+' 新建任务</button>')}<div class="asset-metrics"><div class="asset-metric blue">${icon('file',20)}<span><small>成果总数</small><b>${assets.length}</b></span></div><div class="asset-metric amber">${icon('clock',20)}<span><small>待处理</small><b>${pendingCount}</b></span></div><div class="asset-metric mint">${icon('chart',20)}<span><small>本周更新</small><b>${weekCount||assets.length}</b></span></div><div class="asset-metric violet">${icon('archive',20)}<span><small>已归档</small><b>0</b></span></div></div><section class="asset-recent-open"><div class="asset-section-title"><h2>最近打开</h2><span>继续上次研究</span></div>${recent.map(a=>`<a href="${esc(a.url)}">${projectAssetIcon(a,20)}<div><b>${esc(a.title)}</b><small>${esc(a.kind)} · ${esc(assetDate(a))}</small></div>${icon('arrow',16)}</a>`).join('')}</section><section class="card asset-library"><div class="asset-filter-tabs"><div class="asset-tabs hub-tabs" role="group" aria-label="成果状态">${[['all','全部',assets.length],['draft','草稿',draftCount],['done','已完成',doneCount],['pending','待处理',pendingCount],['archived','已归档',0]].map(([id,label,count])=>`<button data-asset-filter="${id}" class="${id===assetFilter?'active':''}" aria-pressed="${id===assetFilter}">${label}<span>${count}</span></button>`).join('')}</div><label class="asset-search">${icon('search',17)}<input id="asset-query" aria-label="搜索成果或项目名称" value="${esc(assetQuery)}" placeholder="搜索成果名称或项目"></label></div><div class="asset-toolbar"><select id="asset-project-filter" aria-label="筛选所属项目"><option value="all">项目：所有项目</option><option value="none" ${assetProject==='none'?'selected':''}>未归入项目</option>${projects().map(p=>`<option value="${esc(p.id)}" ${assetProject===p.id?'selected':''}>${esc(p.name)}</option>`).join('')}</select><select id="asset-type-filter" aria-label="筛选成果类型"><option value="all">类型：全部类型</option>${assetCategories.filter(([id])=>id!=='all').map(([id,label])=>`<option value="${id}">${label}</option>`).join('')}</select><button class="btn secondary asset-bulk-button" data-asset-bulk>${icon('menu',16)}批量操作</button><select id="asset-sort" aria-label="成果排序">${[['updated','最近更新'],['created','最近创建'],['name','名称排序']].map(([v,n])=>`<option value="${v}" ${assetSort===v?'selected':''}>${n}</option>`).join('')}</select></div><div class="asset-table-caption"><span id="asset-count"></span><span>保存的内容与报告，统一管理</span></div><table class="asset-table"><thead><tr><th scope="col" class="asset-check-cell"><input type="checkbox" aria-label="全选成果" data-asset-select-all></th><th scope="col">成果名称</th><th scope="col">类型</th><th scope="col">所属项目</th><th scope="col">最后更新</th><th scope="col">状态</th><th scope="col">操作</th></tr></thead><tbody id="asset-table-body"></tbody></table><div class="asset-footer">同名内容不自动合并，历史记录均保留。</div>${reportError?'<p class="hub-error">查重报告读取失败，请检查当前浏览器存储权限。</p>':''}</section><div class="asset-backup">${icon('shield',22)}<div><b>本地成果 · 建议定期备份</b><p>内容保存在当前浏览器，更换设备或清理数据可能丢失。</p></div><button class="btn secondary" data-workspace-backup>导出工作空间备份</button></div>`;updateAssetTable();$('#asset-query').addEventListener('input',e=>{assetQuery=e.target.value;updateAssetTable();});$('#asset-project-filter').addEventListener('change',e=>{assetProject=e.target.value;updateAssetTable();});$('#asset-sort').addEventListener('change',e=>{assetSort=e.target.value;updateAssetTable();});$('#asset-type-filter').addEventListener('change',e=>{assetFilter=e.target.value;updateAssetTable();});}
function exportAsset(a){if(a.type==='draft'){modal('导出成果',`<p class="hub-intro">${esc(a.title)}</p><p class="hub-description">${a.tool==='research'?'此处导出 CSV 数据文本；请继续编辑图表以导出 SVG / PNG。':'导出可编辑的纯文本（TXT），不包含排版。'}${a.tool==='format'?'此处导出 TXT 正文；请继续编辑排版文档以导出 DOCX。':''}${a.tool==='ppt'?'此处导出 TXT；请继续编辑演示文稿以导出可编辑 PPTX。':''}</p><button class="btn primary" data-export-draft="${esc(a.id)}">${a.tool==='research'?'下载 CSV 数据':'下载 TXT 文本'}</button>`);return;}modal('导出查重报告',`<p class="hub-intro">${esc(a.title)}</p><p class="hub-description">HTML 保留正文标记和来源证据；JSON 用于数据备份。需要 PDF 可打开报告后打印保存。</p><div class="hub-project-actions"><button class="btn primary" data-report-download="${esc(a.id)}" data-format="html">下载 HTML 报告</button><button class="btn secondary" data-report-download="${esc(a.id)}" data-format="json">下载 JSON 数据</button><a class="btn secondary" href="${esc(a.url)}">打开报告 / 打印 PDF</a></div>`);}
function taskStatus(t){return {completed:'已完成',queued:'排队中',running:'处理中',failed:'失败',cancelled:'已取消',record:'本地记录'}[t.status]||'本地记录';}
function taskTableRow(t){const p=projectOf(t.projectId);return `<tr><td class="task-check-cell"><input type="checkbox" aria-label="选择${esc(t.title)}" data-task-select="${esc(t.id)}"></td><td><div class="task-name"><span class="hub-row-icon ${t.category==='check'?'teal':''}">${icon(t.category==='check'?'search':'file',19)}</span><div><button class="task-title" data-task-detail="${esc(t.id)}">${esc(t.title)}</button><small>${esc(p?.name||'未归入项目')}</small></div></div></td><td><span class="asset-type ${t.category==='check'?'report':''}">${esc(t.typeLabel)}</span></td><td><span class="task-status ${esc(t.status)}"><i></i>${taskStatus(t)}</span></td><td><time class="asset-time">${t.stamp?esc(formatDate(t.createdAt)):'未记录'}</time></td><td><div class="task-actions">${t.url&&t.status==='completed'?`<a href="${esc(t.url)}">${t.category==='check'?'查看报告':'查看成果'}</a>`:''}<button data-task-detail="${esc(t.id)}">详情</button></div></td></tr>`;}
function taskMetric(iconName,tone,label,count,note){return `<div class="task-metric ${tone}"><span class="task-metric-icon">${icon(iconName,20)}</span><div><small>${label}</small><b>${count}</b><em>${note}</em></div>${icon('arrow',15)}</div>`;}
function taskActiveCard(t,index){const progress=t.status==='running'?Math.max(24,68-index*21):12;return `<div class="task-active-card"><span class="hub-row-icon ${t.category==='check'?'teal':''}">${icon(t.category==='check'?'search':'file',21)}</span><div class="task-active-copy"><b>${esc(t.title)}</b><small>${esc(projectOf(t.projectId)?.name||'未归入项目')} · ${esc(t.typeLabel)}</small><div class="task-progress"><span style="width:${progress}%"></span></div><em>${progress}% · ${t.status==='running'?'预计还剩约 12 分钟':'等待开始'}</em></div><button class="btn secondary" data-task-detail="${esc(t.id)}">查看详情</button><button class="text-btn" data-task-detail="${esc(t.id)}">取消任务</button></div>`;}
function updateTaskTable(){const ts=allTasks(),selected=selectTasks(ts,taskFilters,projects());$('#task-count').textContent=`共 ${selected.length} 个任务记录`;$('#task-table-body').innerHTML=selected.map(taskTableRow).join('')||`<tr><td colspan="6"><div class="asset-empty">${icon('clock',32)}<h3>${ts.length?'没有匹配的任务':'开始你的第一个任务'}</h3><p>${ts.length?'调整筛选条件，或搜索其他论文名称。':'保存创作内容或完成本地材料比对后，记录会显示在这里。'}</p>${ts.length?'<button class="btn secondary" data-reset-tasks>清除筛选</button>':'<button class="btn primary" data-new-task>新建任务</button>'}</div></td></tr>`;document.querySelectorAll('[data-task-status]').forEach(b=>{const active=b.dataset.taskStatus===taskFilters.status;b.classList.toggle('active',active);b.setAttribute('aria-pressed',active);});}
function renderTasks(){const ts=allTasks(),processing=ts.filter(t=>statusGroup(t)==='processing'),completed=ts.filter(t=>statusGroup(t)==='completed'),failed=ts.filter(t=>statusGroup(t)==='failed'),pending=ts.filter(t=>['record','cancelled'].includes(statusGroup(t)));$('.dashboard').innerHTML=`${heading('任务中心','管理和跟踪你的研究任务，让科研更加高效。','<button class="btn primary" data-new-task>'+icon('plus',16)+' 新建任务</button>')}<div class="task-metrics">${taskMetric('play','blue','进行中',processing.length,'正在运行的任务')}${taskMetric('hourglass','amber','待处理',pending.length,'等待开始处理')}${taskMetric('check','mint','已完成',completed.length,'成功完成的任务')}${taskMetric('close','red','失败',failed.length,'处理失败的任务')}</div><div class="task-workspace-grid"><section class="card task-active-panel"><div class="task-panel-heading"><div><h2>进行中任务 <span>${processing.length}</span></h2><p>实时查看正在处理的研究内容</p></div><a href="#tasks" data-task-status="processing">查看全部 ${icon('arrow',14)}</a></div>${processing.length?processing.slice(0,3).map(taskActiveCard).join(''):`<div class="task-active-empty">${icon('play',27)}<div><b>暂无进行中的任务</b><p>新建任务后，处理进度会显示在这里。</p></div><a class="btn secondary" href="#category/writing">开始新任务</a></div>`}</section><aside class="card task-reminder"><div class="task-panel-heading"><div><h2>任务提醒</h2><p>当前空间的任务概况</p></div>${icon('bell',18)}</div><div class="task-quota"><span class="task-quota-ring"><b>${ts.length}</b><small>条记录</small></span><div><b>本地任务记录</b><p>当前浏览器已保存的任务</p><strong>${ts.length?`最近更新 ${formatDate(ts[0].createdAt)}`:'还没有任务记录'}</strong></div></div><div class="task-reminder-line">${icon('hourglass',17)}<span>待处理任务 <b>${pending.length}</b></span>${icon('arrow',14)}</div><div class="task-reminder-line">${icon('check',17)}<span>已完成任务 <b>${completed.length}</b></span>${icon('arrow',14)}</div><a class="btn primary task-upgrade" href="#membership/plans">${icon('diamond',16)} 升级会员</a></aside></div><section class="card task-library"><div class="task-library-heading"><div class="task-tabs hub-tabs" role="group" aria-label="任务状态">${taskStatuses.filter(([id])=>id!=='record'||ts.some(t=>t.status==='record')).map(([id,label])=>`<button data-task-status="${id}" aria-pressed="${id===taskFilters.status}" class="${id===taskFilters.status?'active':''}">${label}<span>${id==='all'?ts.length:ts.filter(t=>statusGroup(t)===id).length}</span></button>`).join('')}</div><div class="task-bulk-actions"><button class="btn secondary" data-task-bulk>${icon('menu',15)} 批量操作</button><button class="btn secondary" data-task-export>${icon('download',15)} 导出记录</button></div></div><div class="task-toolbar"><label class="asset-search">${icon('search',17)}<input id="task-query" aria-label="搜索任务" value="${esc(taskFilters.query)}" placeholder="搜索任务名称、项目或任务编号"></label><select id="task-type" aria-label="任务类型">${[['all','全部类型'],['check','论文查重'],['save','内容保存']].map(([v,n])=>`<option value="${v}" ${v===taskFilters.type?'selected':''}>${n}</option>`).join('')}</select><select id="task-project" aria-label="任务所属项目"><option value="all">所有项目</option><option value="none" ${taskFilters.project==='none'?'selected':''}>未归入项目</option>${projects().map(p=>`<option value="${esc(p.id)}" ${taskFilters.project===p.id?'selected':''}>${esc(p.name)}</option>`).join('')}</select><select id="task-period" aria-label="记录时间范围">${[['all','全部时间'],['7','最近 7 天'],['30','最近 30 天'],['90','最近 90 天']].map(([v,n])=>`<option value="${v}" ${taskFilters.days===v?'selected':''}>${n}</option>`).join('')}</select></div><div class="asset-table-caption"><span id="task-count"></span><span>按最近记录时间排序</span></div><div class="task-table-wrap"><table class="task-table"><thead><tr><th scope="col" class="task-check-cell"><input type="checkbox" aria-label="全选任务" data-task-select-all></th><th scope="col">任务名称</th><th scope="col">类型</th><th scope="col">状态</th><th scope="col">记录时间</th><th scope="col">操作</th></tr></thead><tbody id="task-table-body"></tbody></table></div><footer class="asset-footer">保存记录按成果保留最近一次，同名论文的不同记录分别保留。</footer>${reportError?'<p class="hub-error">报告读取失败，列表可能不完整。请检查浏览器存储权限。</p>':''}</section><aside class="task-local-note">${icon('shield',21)}<div><b>当前为本地任务记录</b><p>不代表在线 AI 调用。查重仅覆盖本次对照材料；在线排队、实时进度、取消及重试尚未接入。</p></div><a href="#help">了解功能范围 ${icon('arrow',14)}</a></aside>`;updateTaskTable();$('#task-query').addEventListener('input',e=>{taskFilters.query=e.target.value;updateTaskTable();});for(const [id,key] of [['task-type','type'],['task-project','project'],['task-period','days']])$('#'+id).addEventListener('change',e=>{taskFilters[key]=e.target.value;updateTaskTable();});$('[data-task-select-all]')?.addEventListener('change',e=>document.querySelectorAll('[data-task-select]').forEach(c=>c.checked=e.target.checked));}
function taskDetail(id){const t=allTasks().find(t=>t.id===id);if(!t){notify('当前浏览器中没有这条记录。');return;}const a=t.asset,r=t.report||(a?.type==='report'?a.data:null),p=projectOf(t.projectId),d=a?.data;modal('任务详情',`<div class="task-detail-heading"><h3>${esc(t.title)}</h3><span class="task-status ${esc(t.status)}"><i></i>${taskStatus(t)}</span></div><dl class="task-meta"><dt>任务类型</dt><dd>${esc(t.typeLabel)}</dd><dt>所属项目</dt><dd>${p?`<a href="#project/${encodeURIComponent(p.id)}">${esc(p.name)}</a>`:'未归入项目'}</dd><dt>记录时间</dt><dd>${t.stamp?esc(new Date(t.stamp).toLocaleString('zh-CN')):'未记录'}</dd><dt>输入文件</dt><dd>${esc(d?.fileName||'未记录文件名')}</dd><dt>任务编号</dt><dd>${esc(t.id)}</dd></dl><section class="task-detail-section"><h4>执行记录</h4><div class="task-evidence"><span class="task-evidence-dot">${icon(t.status==='completed'?'shield':'clock',18)}</span><div><b>${r?'比对报告已保存':t.status==='completed'?'内容已保存':'本地操作记录'}</b><p>${esc(t.kind||'已记录本地操作')}</p><small>${t.stamp?esc(formatDate(t.createdAt)):'时间未记录'}</small></div></div>${r?`<div class="task-report-facts"><div>有效检测字数 <b>${Number(r.totalChars||0).toLocaleString('zh-CN')}</b></div><div>匹配来源数量 <b>${Number(r.sourceCount||0)}</b></div><div>检测范围 <b>本地对照材料</b></div></div>`:''}<p class="task-detail-note">${r?'报告保留匹配正文与来源证据。未检索在线学术数据库，不提供在线检索进度。':'仅展示实际保存记录，未调用在线 AI。重复保存只更新当前成果的最近记录。'}</p></section><details class="task-operation-record"><summary>操作记录 <span>1 条已存记录</span></summary><p>${esc(t.kind||'本地操作')} · ${t.stamp?esc(formatDate(t.createdAt)):'时间未记录'}</p><small>当前不保存完整执行日志，不补造历史步骤。</small></details><div class="task-detail-action">${t.url?`<a class="btn primary" href="${esc(t.url)}">${r?'查看查重报告':'打开成果'} ${icon('arrow',15)}</a>`:'<p class="hub-footnote">对应成果当前不可用，任务记录仍保留。</p>'}<a class="btn secondary" href="#help">帮助与说明</a></div>`);$('#'+dialogId).classList.add('task-detail-drawer');}
function renderAccount(section){const p=profile(),pref=preferences();$('.dashboard').innerHTML=heading('账户中心','管理登录账户，设置你的研究偏好。')+`<div class="workspace-account-layout"><section class="card hub-card workspace-account-session" id="workspace-account-session" aria-label="服务账户">${sessionPanel()}</section><section class="card hub-card workspace-account-preferences"><div class="workspace-section-title"><span class="hub-row-icon mint">${icon('book',20)}</span><div><h2>本地研究偏好</h2><p>仅保存在当前浏览器，用于填写研究资料</p></div></div><form id="profile-form" class="hub-form"><label for="profile-name">本地昵称</label><input id="profile-name" required maxlength="20" value="${esc(p.name)}" aria-describedby="profile-name-hint"><p class="workspace-field-hint" id="profile-name-hint">用于本地资料，不修改服务账户名称。</p><div class="hub-form-row"><div><label for="profile-degree">学段 / 身份</label><select id="profile-degree">${['专科','本科','硕士','博士','科研人员'].map(d=>`<option ${d===(p.degree||pref.degree)?'selected':''}>${d}</option>`).join('')}</select></div><div><label for="profile-major">学科专业</label><input id="profile-major" maxlength="100" value="${esc(p.major||'')}"></div></div><label for="profile-direction">研究方向（可选）</label><textarea id="profile-direction" rows="3" maxlength="500" placeholder="例如：人工智能辅助教学">${esc(p.direction||'')}</textarea><button class="btn primary" type="submit">保存研究偏好</button><span class="workspace-save-status" id="profile-save-status" role="status"></span></form></section><section class="card hub-card workspace-account-security" id="account-security">${securityPanel()}</section><aside class="workspace-account-storage">${icon('shield',21)}<div><b>你的本地研究内容仍由你管理</b><p>退出账户不会删除当前浏览器的项目、草稿与偏好。换设备前，建议导出备份。</p><a href="#settings/privacy">查看数据保存说明 ${icon('arrow',13)}</a></div></aside></div>`;$('#profile-form').addEventListener('submit',e=>{e.preventDefault();const name=$('#profile-name').value.trim();if(!name){notify('请填写本地昵称。');return;}guard(()=>{write(keys.profile,{...profile(),name,degree:$('#profile-degree').value,major:$('#profile-major').value.trim(),direction:$('#profile-direction').value.trim()});updateProfile();$('#profile-save-status').textContent='已保存到当前浏览器';notify('本地研究偏好已保存。');});});if(section==='security')$('#account-security').scrollIntoView({block:'start'});}
function updateProfile(){document.querySelectorAll('.hub-profile-name').forEach(n=>n.textContent=accountName());document.querySelectorAll('.hub-profile-caption').forEach(n=>n.textContent=accountCaption());document.querySelectorAll('.hub-sidebar-profile .hub-avatar,.hub-top-profile .hub-avatar').forEach(n=>{n.innerHTML=workspaceSession.user?esc(Array.from(accountName())[0]):icon('user',17);});renderAccountMenu();}
function renderSettings(section){mountSettings({modal,notify,apply:applyPreferences,exportBackup:exportWorkspace,restored:async()=>{reports=await repository.all('reports');reportError=false;updateProfile();applyPreferences();refreshAssets();}},section);}
function renderMembership(){mountMembership({modal,reportRows:reports,reportError});}
function renderOrders(){ $('.dashboard').innerHTML=heading('订单记录','正式支付与订单服务尚未接入。')+`<section class="card hub-card">${empty('暂无订单，当前本地体验不会产生扣款。','#membership','查看会员与用量')}<p class="hub-footnote">不生成模拟支付成功记录；正式服务上线后显示真实订单与支付状态。</p></section>`;}
function renderHelp(){mountHelp({modal,notify});}
function renderCategory(key){const c=allCategories.find(c=>c[0]===key);if(!c){overview();return;}if(key==='more'){mountMore({modal,notify});return;}if(key==='format'){mountFormat({modal,notify});return;}if(key==='research'){mountResearch({modal,notify});return;}if(key==='ppt'){mountPresentation({modal,notify});return;}if(key==='writing'){mountWritingLanding();return;}if(key==='detection'){mountDetection({modal,notify,projectId:routeInfo().params.get('project'),tab:'check'});return;}if(key==='aigc'){mountDetection({modal,notify,projectId:routeInfo().params.get('project'),tab:'ai'});return;}if(key==='reduce'){mountRevision({modal,notify,mode:'reduce'});return;}if(key==='revision'){mountRevision({modal,notify});return;}if(key==='literature'){mountLiterature({modal,notify});return;}$('.dashboard').innerHTML=heading(c[1],'选择具体任务，进入对应的操作页面。')+`<div class="hub-tool-grid">${c[3].map(id=>{const name=id==='check'?'论文查重':toolConfigs[id][0],desc=id==='check'?'解析正文，与本地对照材料执行文本比对。':toolConfigs[id][1],status=id==='check'?'本地材料比对':id==='research'?'本地绘图':id==='aigc'?'检测未接入':'结构或流程模板';return `<a class="hub-tool-card" href="${id==='check'?'#category/detection':'#tool/'+id}"><span class="hub-row-icon">${icon(id==='check'?'search':c[2],25)}</span>${badge(status,'gray')}<h2>${name}</h2><p>${desc}</p><span>开始使用 ${icon('arrow',14)}</span></a>`;}).join('')}</div><p class="hub-footnote">AI、在线检索与正式检测服务尚未接入，当前能力以各页面说明为准。</p>`;}
function renderSearch(q){$('.dashboard').innerHTML=heading('搜索结果',`搜索“${esc(q)}”，范围为项目标题、成果标题和工具名称。`)+`<section class="card hub-card"><h2>项目</h2>${projects().filter(p=>p.name.includes(q)).map(projectRow).join('')||empty('没有匹配的项目。')}</section><section class="card hub-card"><h2>成果</h2>${assets.filter(a=>a.title.includes(q)||a.kind.includes(q)).map(assetRow).join('')||empty('没有匹配的成果。')}</section><section class="card hub-card"><h2>工具</h2>${Object.entries(toolConfigs).filter(([,c])=>(c[0]+c[1]).includes(q)).map(([id,c])=>`<a class="hub-search-result" href="#tool/${id}">${icon('file')}<span>${esc(c[0])}</span>${icon('arrow',14)}</a>`).join('')||empty('没有匹配的工具。')}</section>`;}
function routeInfo(){const hash=location.hash.slice(1)||'home',at=hash.indexOf('?'),path=at>=0?hash.slice(0,at):hash,params=new URLSearchParams(at>=0?hash.slice(at+1):'');return {parts:path.split('/'),params};}
function render(){const previousCatalog=$('.writing-catalog'),previousScroll=window.scrollY,previousFocus=previousCatalog?.contains(document.activeElement)?document.activeElement:null;clearEditor();clearHelpWork();clearSettingsWork();clearMoreWork();refreshAssets();$('.dashboard').className='page dashboard hub-page';navigation?.close();$('#account-menu').hidden=true;const {parts,params}=routeInfo(),route=parts[0],id=parts[1];let active='#'+route,title={home:'工作台',projects:'我的项目',project:'我的项目',assets:'我的成果',recent:'我的成果',tasks:'任务中心',account:'账户中心',settings:'设置中心',membership:'会员与用量',orders:'订单记录',help:'帮助与反馈',search:'搜索'}[route]||'研究工作台';
if(route==='category'){const key=legacy[id]||id;active='#category/'+key;title=allCategories.find(c=>c[0]===key)?.[1]||title;renderCategory(key);if(key==='literature'){if(params.get('view')==='search')openLiteratureSearch({modal,notify});if(params.get('view')==='translation'||params.get('tool')==='translation')openLiteratureTranslation({modal,notify});}}else if(route==='literature'){active='#category/literature';title='文献研读';mountLiteratureReader(id,{modal,notify},params.get('tab')||'text');}else if(route==='tool'){const parent=allCategories.find(c=>c[3].includes(id));active='#category/'+(parent?.[0]||'writing');if(['reading','search'].includes(id)){active='#category/literature';mountLiterature({modal,notify});}else if(id==='journal'){active='#category/more';mountMoreEditor('posting',{modal,notify},undefined,params.get('project'));}else if(['posting','resume'].includes(id)){mountMoreEditor(id,{modal,notify},undefined,params.get('project'));}else if(id==='translation'){active='#category/literature';mountLiterature({modal,notify});openLiteratureTranslation({modal,notify});}else if(id==='format'){mountFormat({modal,notify},undefined,params.get('project'));}else if(id==='research'){mountResearch({modal,notify},undefined,params.get('project'));}else if(id==='ppt'){mountPresentation({modal,notify},undefined,params.get('project'));}else if(id==='aigc'){mountDetection({modal,notify,projectId:params.get('project'),tab:'ai'});}else if(['review','rewrite','reduce'].includes(id)){mountRevision({modal,notify,mode:id});}else if(!mountTool(id,undefined,params.get('project'),{modal,notify})){overview();notify('没有找到对应工具。');}title=toolConfigs[id]?.[0]||title;}else if(route==='draft'){const d=list(keys.drafts).find(d=>String(d.id)===id);active='#category/'+(allCategories.find(c=>c[3].includes(d?.tool||'writing'))?.[0]||'writing');if(['posting','resume'].includes(d?.tool))mountMoreEditor(d.tool,{modal,notify},d.id);else if(d?.tool==='format')mountFormat({modal,notify},d.id);else if(d?.tool==='research')mountResearch({modal,notify},d.id);else if(d?.tool==='ppt')mountPresentation({modal,notify},d.id);else if(d?.revision)mountRevision({modal,notify},d.id);else if(d)mountTool(d.tool||'writing',d.id,undefined,{modal,notify});else{$('.dashboard').innerHTML=empty('当前浏览器中没有此成果。','#assets','查看成果');}title=d?.title||'成果不存在';}else if(route==='projects')renderProjects();else if(route==='project'){active='#projects';projectDetail(id);}else if(route==='assets'||route==='recent'){active='#assets';if(['all','detection'].includes(params.get('category'))){assetFilter=params.get('category');assetProject='all';assetQuery='';}renderAssets();}else if(route==='tasks')renderTasks();else if(route==='account')renderAccount(id);else if(route==='settings')renderSettings(id);else if(route==='membership'){if(id==='plans'){title='开通会员';mountMemberPlans(params.get('period'));}else if(id==='checkout'){title='确认购买方案';mountMemberCheckout(params.get('plan'),params.get('quantity'),params.get('kind'));}else if(['bundles','recharge','redeem'].includes(id)){title='会员与购买中心';mountCommerce(id);}else{renderMembership();if(params.get('section')==='features')$('#member-features').scrollIntoView({block:'start'});}}else if(route==='orders')renderOrders();else if(route==='help')renderHelp();else if(route==='search'){let q='';try{q=decodeURIComponent(id||'');}catch{}renderSearch(q);}else{active='#home';overview();}const currentCatalog=$('.writing-catalog');retainWritingCatalog(previousCatalog,currentCatalog,previousFocus);$('.breadcrumb strong').textContent=title;document.querySelectorAll('.sidebar .nav-link').forEach(a=>{const selected=a.getAttribute('href')===active;a.classList.toggle('active',selected);if(selected)a.setAttribute('aria-current','page');else a.removeAttribute('aria-current');});if(!['privacy','security'].includes(id)&&!(route==='membership'&&params.get('section')==='features'))window.scrollTo({top:previousCatalog&&currentCatalog?previousScroll:0,behavior:'instant'});}
document.addEventListener('click',async e=>{if(e.target.closest('[data-session-logout]')){await signOutWorkspace();return;}if(e.target.closest('[data-session-retry]')){e.target.closest('[data-session-retry]').disabled=true;await loadWorkspaceSession(true);return;}const resultTab=e.target.closest('[data-project-result-filter]');if(resultTab){projectResultFilter=resultTab.dataset.projectResultFilter;projectRows();document.querySelector(`[data-project-result-filter="${projectResultFilter}"]`)?.focus({preventScroll:true});return;}const allProjectAssets=e.target.closest('[data-project-all-assets]');if(allProjectAssets){assetProject=allProjectAssets.dataset.projectAllAssets;assetFilter='all';assetQuery='';location.hash='assets';return;}const menu=e.target.closest('[data-account-menu]');if(menu){renderAccountMenu();$('#account-menu').hidden=!$('#account-menu').hidden;return;}if(!e.target.closest('#account-menu'))$('#account-menu').hidden=true;if(e.target.closest('[data-reset-assets]')){assetFilter='all';assetProject='all';assetQuery='';renderAssets();return;}const ex=e.target.closest('[data-asset-export]');if(ex){const a=assetByToken(ex.dataset.assetExport);if(a)exportAsset(a);return;}const rd=e.target.closest('[data-report-download]');if(rd){const r=reports.find(r=>r.id===rd.dataset.reportDownload);if(!r)return;const html=rd.dataset.format==='html';download((r.title||'论文')+'-PaperKnow报告.'+(html?'html':'json'),html?reportHtml(r):JSON.stringify(r,null,2),html?'text/html':'application/json');notify('已发起报告下载。');return;}const info=e.target.closest('[data-asset-info]');if(info){const a=assetByToken(info.dataset.assetInfo);if(a)modal('成果信息',`<div class="hub-status-lines"><div>名称 <b>${esc(a.title)}</b></div><div>类型 <b>${esc(a.kind)}</b></div><div>所属项目 <b>${esc(projectOf(a.projectId)?.name||'未归入项目')}</b></div><div>更新时间 <b>${esc(assetDate(a))}</b></div></div><p class="hub-description">${esc(assetDescription(a))}</p><p class="hub-footnote">记录编号：${esc(a.id)}。内容保存在当前浏览器。</p>`);return;}const taskDetailButton=e.target.closest('[data-task-detail]');if(taskDetailButton){taskDetail(taskDetailButton.dataset.taskDetail);return;}const taskStatusButton=e.target.closest('[data-task-status]');if(taskStatusButton){taskFilters.status=taskStatusButton.dataset.taskStatus;updateTaskTable();return;}const taskBulk=e.target.closest('[data-task-bulk]');if(taskBulk){const chosen=[...document.querySelectorAll('[data-task-select]:checked')].length;notify(chosen?`已选择 ${chosen} 条任务，可进行批量归档或删除。`:'请先选择要批量处理的任务。');return;}const taskExport=e.target.closest('[data-task-export]');if(taskExport){const rows=selectTasks(allTasks(),taskFilters,projects());const csv=['任务名称,类型,状态,记录时间',...rows.map(t=>[t.title,t.typeLabel,taskStatus(t),formatDate(t.createdAt)].map(v=>'"'+String(v).replaceAll('\"','\"\"')+'"').join(','))].join('\n');download('PaperKnow-任务记录.csv',csv,'text/csv;charset=utf-8');notify('已导出当前任务记录。');return;}if(e.target.closest('[data-reset-tasks]')){taskFilters={status:'all',type:'all',project:'all',query:'',days:'all'};renderTasks();return;}const backup=e.target.closest('[data-workspace-backup]');if(backup){exportWorkspace();return;}const stage=e.target.closest('[data-stage-project]');if(stage){stageForm(stage.dataset.stageProject);return;}const view=e.target.closest('[data-project-view]');if(view){projectView=view.dataset.projectView;guard(()=>write(keys.preferences,{...preferences(),projectView}));renderProjects();return;}if(e.target.closest('[data-reset-projects]')){projectQuery='';activeProjectFilter='all';renderProjects();return;}const newTaskButton=e.target.closest('[data-new-task]');if(newTaskButton){newTask();return;}const uploadButton=e.target.closest('[data-upload-task]');if(uploadButton){uploadTask();return;}const homeTab=e.target.closest('[data-home-tab]');if(homeTab){document.querySelectorAll('[data-home-tab]').forEach(b=>{const active=b===homeTab;b.classList.toggle('active',active);b.setAttribute('aria-selected',active?'true':'false');});const target={continue:'#home-resume',results:'#home-results',tasks:'#tasks'}[homeTab.dataset.homeTab];if(target){if(target==='#tasks')location.hash='tasks';else document.querySelector(target)?.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'start'});}return;}const homeFilter=e.target.closest('[data-home-filter]');if(homeFilter){homeAssetFilter=homeFilter.dataset.homeFilter;$('#home-results').innerHTML=homeResults();requestAnimationFrame(adaptHomeLayout);$('#home-results').querySelector(`[data-home-filter="${homeAssetFilter}"]`)?.focus({preventScroll:true});return;}if(e.target.closest('#workspace-dialog a[href]'))$('#'+dialogId).close();const newP=e.target.closest('[data-new-project]');if(newP){projectForm();return;}const edit=e.target.closest('[data-edit-project]');if(edit){projectForm(edit.dataset.editProject);return;}const archive=e.target.closest('[data-archive-project]');if(archive){guard(()=>{const id=archive.dataset.archiveProject;write(keys.projects,projects().map(p=>p.id===id?{...p,status:p.status==='archived'?'active':'archived',updatedAt:new Date().toISOString()}:p));render();notify('项目状态已更新，成果仍保留。');});return;}const link=e.target.closest('[data-link-project]');if(link){linkProject(link.dataset.linkProject);return;}const pf=e.target.closest('[data-project-filter]');if(pf){activeProjectFilter=pf.dataset.projectFilter;renderProjects();return;}const bulk=e.target.closest('[data-asset-bulk]');if(bulk){const chosen=[...document.querySelectorAll('[data-asset-select]:checked')].length;notify(chosen?`已选择 ${chosen} 份成果，可进行批量导出或移动。`:'请先选择要批量处理的成果。');return;}const af=e.target.closest('[data-asset-filter]');if(af){assetFilter=af.dataset.assetFilter;renderAssets();return;}const binding=e.target.closest('[data-bind-asset]');if(binding){const token=binding.dataset.bindAsset,index=token.indexOf(':');await bindAsset(token.slice(0,index),token.slice(index+1),binding.dataset.targetProject);return;}const manage=e.target.closest('[data-asset-project]');if(manage){const token=manage.dataset.assetProject,i=token.indexOf(':'),a=assets.find(a=>a.type===token.slice(0,i)&&a.id===token.slice(i+1));modal('管理项目关联',`<form class="hub-form" id="asset-binding-form"><label for="asset-project-select">所属项目</label><select id="asset-project-select"><option value="">未归入项目</option>${projects().map(p=>`<option value="${esc(p.id)}" ${a?.projectId===p.id?'selected':''}>${esc(p.name)}${p.status==='archived'?'（已归档）':''}</option>`).join('')}</select><button class="btn primary" type="submit">保存关联</button></form>`);$('#asset-binding-form').addEventListener('submit',async ev=>{ev.preventDefault();const projectId=$('#asset-project-select').value;$('#'+dialogId).close();await bindAsset(token.slice(0,i),token.slice(i+1),projectId);});return;}const exportD=e.target.closest('[data-export-draft]');if(exportD){const d=list(keys.drafts).find(d=>String(d.id)===exportD.dataset.exportDraft);if(!d)return;let text=d.text||'';if(!text&&d.html){const div=document.createElement('div');div.innerHTML=d.html;div.querySelectorAll('p,h3,h4').forEach(n=>n.append(document.createTextNode('\n')));text=div.textContent||'';}if(!text.trim()){notify('这份成果尚无正文，请先继续编辑并保存内容。');return;}download((d.title||'论文成果')+(d.tool==='research'?'.csv':'.txt'),text,d.tool==='research'?'text/csv;charset=utf-8':'text/plain;charset=utf-8');$('#'+dialogId).close();notify('已发起文本下载。');}});
window.addEventListener('scroll',()=>{if(location.hash==='#home'&&window.scrollY<80){const tab=document.querySelector('[data-home-tab=overview]');if(tab){document.querySelectorAll('[data-home-tab]').forEach(b=>{const active=b===tab;b.classList.toggle('active',active);b.setAttribute('aria-selected',active?'true':'false');});}}},{passive:true});window.addEventListener('hashchange',e=>{if(!isCurrentRouteChange(e,location.href))return;if(!editorRouteGuard(new URL(e.newURL).hash)||!helpRouteGuard(new URL(e.newURL).hash)||!settingsRouteGuard(new URL(e.newURL).hash)||!moreRouteGuard(new URL(e.newURL).hash)||!formatRouteGuard()||!researchRouteGuard()||!presentationRouteGuard()||!revisionRouteGuard()||!detectionRouteGuard()){history.replaceState(null,'',e.oldURL);return;}render();});window.addEventListener('storage',()=>{if(editorHasWork()||revisionHasWork()||helpHasWork()||settingsHasWork()||moreHasWork()||formatHasWork()||researchHasWork()||presentationHasWork()||!detectionRouteGuard())return;updateProfile();applyPreferences();render();});document.addEventListener('keydown',e=>{if(e.key==='Escape'){$('#account-menu').hidden=true;navigation?.close();}});
window.addEventListener('focus',()=>{if(Date.now()-sessionCheckedAt>=30000)loadWorkspaceSession();});
shell();void loadWorkspaceSession();try{reports=(await repository.all('reports')).sort((a,b)=>String(b.createdAt).localeCompare(String(a.createdAt)));}catch{reportError=true;}render();
